'''Classical Arts''' (伝統芸能, ''Dentō Gēnō'', '''Traditional Entertainment''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (Sm): Slow duration increases by 10%.

